# Comments must sit on their own line: Git reads "x  # note" as the pattern
# "x  # note", which matches nothing.

# --- Secrets: never commit these -------------------------------------------
# API keys live in Infisical and reach the app as environment variables
# (see GUIDE.md, "Going live"). These are where keys usually leak from.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.streamlit/secrets.toml
# .infisical.yaml is SAFE to commit: it only links this folder to an
# Infisical project ID and holds no secret values.

# --- Local data ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Case history: senders and subjects of every triaged email. Sensitive.
.cache/
# Design-tool screenshots and logs.
.hallmark/

# --- Python -------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# --- Local tooling (editor and AI-assistant settings, not part of the app) ----
.claude/
.agents/
